{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat monsters and climb floors! Carteado is an endless casual survival top-down card shooter game, where you use your cards to defeat monsters, while building your deck and unlocking new cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/373307059524a9587603479334f41bac.poster.avif?t=1752755308\" aria-label=\"explore\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/373307059524a9587603479334f41bac.webm?t=1752755308\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/373307059524a9587603479334f41bac.mp4?t=1752755308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter this procedural dungeon</strong>, where with each floor you advance, the rooms get bigger and the enemies more powerful. Find items and cards that will help you on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/24c93fcb88eba26065cb61062557a604.poster.avif?t=1752755308\" aria-label=\"build your deck\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/24c93fcb88eba26065cb61062557a604.webm?t=1752755308\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect cards with different powers</strong> during the adventure to build your deck and defeat monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/54264a0717e42a93594e205b9b010d85.poster.avif?t=1752755308\" aria-label=\"battle\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/54264a0717e42a93594e205b9b010d85.webm?t=1752755308\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/54264a0717e42a93594e205b9b010d85.mp4?t=1752755308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle monsters during your adventure</strong> to get tokens. Use them to buy items that improve your attributes or upgrade your deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you defeat bosses, you get jokers that change the mechanics of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features over <strong>6</strong> different monsters and <strong>5</strong> unique bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/c23fd140a1942121f0735046d0d718a6.poster.avif?t=1752755308\" aria-label=\"unlock new cards\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/c23fd140a1942121f0735046d0d718a6.webm?t=1752755308\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover more than 20 unique cards</strong>, complete challenges and unlock new cards to enrich your future adventures!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863510?t=1752755308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/1320caa44b3c92eb26d17840a513d82f1da9bb7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752755308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/f75e74ffb157f4f0b03ccbc945b25ec16a8ddbb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752755308",